  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif his sunu 7 his sunu sunu þæt geþeoð, þæt hi swa micel landes habban, siððan bið se ofsprinc gesiðcundes cynnes be twam þusendum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if his son and his son's son prosper, so that they have so much land, then the offspring is of gesith-born class, at 2000 thrymsas.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif his sunu 7 his suna sunu þæt geþeoð, þæt hy swa micel landes habbað, syððan byþ se ofspring gesiðcundes cynnes be twam ðusendum þrymsa.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if his son and his son's son prosper so that they have sufficient land, than then the offspring will be of the rank of gesith at two thousand thrymsas.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
